bove or below the season's mean in proportion to the other league's clubs; within its league a club stands (W% − ½ − f × Δ) ÷ ((1 − f) × n/(n − 1) + f) above its league's mean, f the share of its league's games that were interleague and n the clubs of its league; m 0.0242, the win share a point of strength is worth in the engine under 2011's rules. Every player of the club moves by one whole number and the best few of its lineup by one more, so nobody passes a teammate.","licence":"WAR: JEFFBAGWELL (Neil Paine), MIT. Names, birthplaces, clubs and ballparks: the Baseball Databank (Chadwick Baseball Bureau), CC BY-SA 3.0; its home games from Retrosheet. See public/baseball/ATTRIBUTION.txt.","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Neil-Paine-1/MLB-WAR-data-historical/1c8c3084d62112efdaa7054125af3cd01003e38d/jeffbagwell_war_historical_2025.csv","retrieved":"2026-11-10","rawScale":"WAR"},"map":"mlb2010","nations":{"124":[73,25,[["Russell Martin","C/3B",81],["George Kottaras","C",71],["Mike Nickeas","C",65],["Joey Votto","1B",89],["Justin Morneau","1B",77],["Matt Stairs","1B/LF/RF",67],["Pete Orr","2B/3B",66],["Taylor Green","2B/3B",63],["Brett Lawrie","3B",82],["Jason Bay","LF",78],["Rene Tosoni","LF/RF",63],["Michael Saunders","CF/LF",67],["Adam Loewen","RF/CF",62],["Erik Bedard","SP",75],["Ryan Dempster","SP",75],["Jeff Francis","SP",73],["Rich Harden","SP",68],["Scott Diamond","SP",62],["John Axford","RP",82],["Jesse Crain","RP",80],["Chris Leroux","RP",70],["Blake Hawksworth","RP",68],["Scott Richmond","RP",67],["Trystan Magnuson","RP",59],["Scott Mathieson","RP",58]]],"158":[49,3,[["Chin-lung Hu","2B/SS",57],["Chien-Ming Wang","SP",64],["Hung-Chih Kuo","RP",72]]],"170":[52,4,[["Orlando Cabrera","2B/3B/SS",71],["Edgar Renteria","SS/2B",71],["Julio Teheran","SP",63],["Ernesto Frieri","RP",69]]],"192":[67,17,[["Brayan Pena","C",74],["Juan Miranda","1B",70],["Alexei Ramirez","SS",84],["Yunel Escobar","SS",82],["Yuniesky Betancourt","SS",71],["Jose Iglesias","SS",45],["